/** Determines whether the given call expression node has object expression source arguments (all but the first) with `__proto__` properties. The first argument is not checked. It is the target of the assignment, and its properties are inlined into the resulting object literal with the same meaning they already had. Properties of the other arguments are copied by `Object.assign` with `[[Set]]`, and that is the step the autofix removes. */
